{
  "id": "2SA.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samuel 1",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "David Hears of Saul's Death",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After the death of Saul, David returned from striking down the Amalekites and stayed in Ziklag two days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the third day a man arrived from Saul's camp with his clothes torn and dust on his head. When he came to David, he fell to the ground to pay him honor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Where have you come from?\" David asked him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2SA 1:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He answered, \"I have escaped from the Israelite camp.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"What happened?\" David asked. \"Tell me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2SA 1:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"The men fled from the battle,\" he replied. \"Many of them fell and died. And Saul and his son Jonathan are dead.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David said to the young man who brought him the report, \"How do you know that Saul and his son Jonathan are dead?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I happened to be on Mount Gilboa,\" the young man said, \"and there was Saul, leaning on his spear, with the chariots and their drivers in hot pursuit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he turned around and saw me, he called out to me, and I said, 'What can I do?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"He asked me, 'Who are you?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2SA 1:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'An Amalekite,' I answered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Then he said to me, 'Stand here by me and kill me! I'm in the throes of death, but I'm still alive.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"So I stood beside him and killed him, because I knew that after he had fallen he could not survive. And I took the crown that was on his head and the band on his arm and have brought them here to my lord.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David and all the men with him took hold of their clothes and tore them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They mourned and wept and fasted till evening for Saul and his son Jonathan, and for the army of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and for the nation of Israel, because they had fallen by the sword.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David said to the young man who brought him the report, \"Where are you from?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2SA 1:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I am the son of a foreigner, an Amalekite,\" he answered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David asked him, \"Why weren't you afraid to lift your hand to destroy the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s anointed?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David called one of his men and said, \"Go, strike him down!\" So he struck him down, and he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For David had said to him, \"Your blood be on your own head. Your own mouth testified against you when you said, 'I killed the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.1.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s anointed.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "David's Lament for Saul and Jonathan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David took up this lament concerning Saul and his son Jonathan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he ordered that the people of Judah be taught this lament of the bow (it is written in the Book of Jashar):",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"A gazelle",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "lies slain on your heights, Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2SA 1:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "How the mighty have fallen!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Tell it not in Gath,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2SA 1:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "proclaim it not in the streets of Ashkelon,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2SA 1:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "lest the daughters of the Philistines be glad,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2SA 1:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "lest the daughters of the uncircumcised rejoice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Mountains of Gilboa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2SA 1:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "may you have neither dew nor rain,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2SA 1:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "may no showers fall on your terraced fields.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2SA 1:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "For there the shield of the mighty was despised,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2SA 1:21"
      },
